    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It happens a few times a day. A eight out of ten, I suppose. It settles a little with honey. It's worse with cold air. And there's a tickle in my throat as well, about four days now. About tickle in my throat, pretty severe, if I'm being honest.",
