      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I only drink at family occasions. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. No, I share a house with my brother. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day.",
